join (values (cast(-1 as decimal(20,2)) v), (cast(0 as decimal(20,2)))) b on a.d64 = b.v
---- RESULTS
2
---- TYPES
BIGINT
---- RUNTIME_PROFILE
aggregation(SUM, NumRuntimeFilteredPages): 4
